  "description": "A high-performance UUID library that combines the best features of GUIDv7, ULID and CUID. Features include:\n- Sortable by creation time\n- Cryptographically secure random numbers\n- High performance and thread-safe\n- Compatible with System.Guid\n- Support for Base32 and Base64 encoding\n- Comprehensive test coverage",
